-- =============================================================================
-- AyNesil :: Rollback for V38–V41 (#86 tenant integrity)
-- NOT A FLYWAY MIGRATION — kept outside db/migrations on purpose (Flyway Community has no
-- undo support, and an R__-prefixed file there would run as a repeatable migration).
--
-- Run manually as the owner role, then re-run Flyway only after fixing whatever required the
-- rollback:
--     psql "$OWNER_URL" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -f db/rollback/V38-V41__tenant_integrity_down.sql
--
-- Restores the original single-column FKs with their original names and ON DELETE actions
-- (existing data is consistent with them, so they are added VALID), drops the scope triggers,
-- the trigger function and the unique indexes, and removes V38–V41 from flyway_schema_history.
-- =============================================================================

begin;
